    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo is pleased to present 220 The Island, a bright two-bedroom 2nd floor apartment in the established riverside development at Chapelizod. The apartment has an open-plan living and dining space, a separate fitted kitchen, two bedrooms and a bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe living and dining room is filled with natural light from broad windows and opens to a balcony. There are leafy views across the development and towards the river. A separate utility/storage space houses the washer/dryer.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are laid out as doubles, with fitted wardrobes. The bathroom has a bath with shower over it. The property also has a designated underground parking space. The owner advises that the apartment is vacant and available immediately.\r\nThe balcony, parking and position beside the river and Phoenix Park make this an appealing home for buyers seeking a convenient village location.\r\n\r\nThe Island sits in beautifully kept grounds, with a large green area at the bottom of the development right beside the river. The village is a short walk away over the river, so shops, cafes and everyday amenities are close by.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nThe Island sits in Chapelizod village by the River Liffey. Local shops, cafés and places to eat are close by, while Phoenix Park is within easy walking distance for open space, walking and cycling. Bus services on the nearby route connect Chapelizod with Dublin city centre and west Dublin. The location also gives road access towards the city centre and the M50. Buyers can enjoy a village setting while remaining connected to the rest of Dublin.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
      {
