        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large open plan living & dining\r\nSouth facing balcony\r\nNo rent caps\r\nSeparate fitted kitchen and utility/storage space\r\nTwo double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes\r\nBathroom with bath and shower over\r\nDesignated underground parking space\r\nConstructed in 2003\r\nVacant and available immediately\r\nSuperbly maintained development green space\r\nPositioned in Chapelizod village by the River Liffey\r\nShops and cafés nearby\r\nPhoenix Park within easy walking distance\r\nBus connections to Dublin city centre and west Dublin\r\nRoad connections towards the city centre and M50"
